      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COIN KEEPING (3) is generally an honest type in the frame at eight of 15 starts but missed the placings last time when fifth (25.41) over 440m at Goulburn. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of five starts. Well placed here and can go close with a clear run. DEPENDABLE (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.80) at Richmond behind Spring Cosmic in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. YANDAMA (8) scored (23.62) last time out over 410m at Horsham five months ago. Will go close here with a clear run. OVERINDULGE (6) generally performs well over this distance.",
